---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AuroraCore - Manifesto" description="AuroraCore manifesto">
  <article class="glass-card space-y-4 fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 180ms;">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-heading)]">VISION :: MANIFESTO</h1>
    <p>
      AuroraCore treats intent as the primary unit of computation. Interfaces are no longer the center.
      Deterministic goals, shared memory, and machine-native coordination become the operating model.
    </p>
    <p>
      This project is an R&D engine first: infrastructure is discovered through experiments, then promoted into
      stable primitives for humans and agents.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
